<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WICOR Inc started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WICOR Inc started as hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of WICOR Inc as a hold.</p>
<p>-- expects to earn $2.70 a share in 1997 and $3.05 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- said believe WICOR is &quot;fairly valued&quot; between $36 and $38 a share.</p>
<p>-- WICOR was unchanged at 37.</p>
</text>
